# Copy to api_secrets.env (gitignored — never commit it) and fill in.
# Referenced as {env:BB_USER} / {env:BB_PASS} by the @auth scenario in
# features/busterblock_api.feature, which logs in to the local BusterBlock test
# app and chains the returned JWT into a bearer-protected DELETE.
#
# Secrets are PACKAGE-scoped: the web busterblock package's own secrets file
# does not reach this api package, which is why this copy exists.
# See ../../../docs/feature-packages.md for the resolution order.

